---
source: components/nonmem/src/scm/snapshot_tests.rs
expression: out
---
unknown_name
  no $PK term named AGE_CL; terms in this template referencing a single THETA: WT_CL, CRCL_CL, WT_V, CL, V, KA
unknown_name_no_eligible_terms
  no $PK term named WT_CL; terms in this template referencing a single THETA: KA
term_references_several_thetas
  $PK term TVCL references THETAs [1, 4, 5]; a covariate term must reference exactly one
term_references_no_theta
  $PK term S2 does not reference any THETA, so it cannot name a covariate effect
duplicate_names
  covariate name wt_cl is requested more than once
two_names_one_theta
  covariate names WT_CL and WT_CL_ALIAS both resolve to THETA(4)
empty_name
  covariates contains an empty name
empty_list
  [covariates] effects must name at least one $PK term, e.g. effects = ["WT_CL", "CRCL_CL"]
no_estimation_record
  template model [TMP]/no_estimation_record/1001.mod has no $ESTIMATION record
no_pk_block
  cannot resolve covariate names: the template has no $PK or $PRED block
term_past_last_theta
  $PK term WT_V references THETA(9) but the model only has 6 thetas
direction_empty
  direction must contain 'forward', 'backward', or both
direction_duplicated
  direction contains 'forward' more than once
forward_alpha_zero
  forward_alpha must be in (0, 1), got 0
backward_alpha_one
  backward_alpha must be in (0, 1), got 1
num_rounds_zero
  num_rounds must be at least 1
initial_equals_off_row
  WT_CL: initial (1) equals off (1): an effect released at its off value is not tested at all
initial_equals_off_defaults
  [covariates] initial (0) equals off (0): an effect released at its off value is not tested at all
initial_nan
  WT_CL: initial must be a finite number, got NaN
off_infinite
  [covariates] off must be a finite number, got inf
missing_dataset
  dataset data.csv referenced by $DATA does not exist (resolved to [TMP]/missing_dataset/data.csv)
missing_model
  Model file does not exist: [TMP]/nope.mod
bad_extension
  Model file [TMP]/bad_extension/1001.txt has unsupported extension '.txt': only .mod and .ctl are allowed
